<title>USA: Banco Santiago Q2 net ADS rises.</title>
<headline>Banco Santiago Q2 net ADS rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS shr		    $0.55		    $0.48</p>
<p> Net			 19,988		   18,293</p>
<p> Interest rev	   116,334		  146,340</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Net			 33,477		   37,087</p>
<p> Interest rev	   244,062		  249,067</p>
<p>(All data above in million of Chilean pesos except per share numbers, which are in U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>NOTE: The exchange rate for the ADS per-share earnings is 416.06 Chilean pesos to one U.S.dollar.</p>
<p>The second quarter of 1996 results are the pro-forma consolidated figures for Banco Santiago and Banco O'Higgins.</p>
</text>
